WEBVTT

00:03.110 --> 00:05.520
Hear my call, Alluria!

00:07.450 --> 00:09.860
Come forth, Nardrea!

00:13.000 --> 00:14.540
Don't leave me behind...

00:14.970 --> 00:16.250
Ellenor!

00:40.320 --> 00:41.440
I can't reach her...

00:42.190 --> 00:45.150
I'll never reach her like this.

00:46.440 --> 00:47.490
But...

00:47.990 --> 00:49.950
I can't give up.

00:49.950 --> 00:51.660
I don't want to give up.

00:52.200 --> 00:53.430
Ellenor!

00:54.020 --> 00:56.700
Bloom, Fleuria!

02:23.080 --> 02:26.330
EPISODE 10: OUR DREAMS

02:33.550 --> 02:36.390
I'm a flunkee.

02:37.220 --> 02:43.520
I'm the only elf who's still
at the Academy after six years.

02:43.520 --> 02:47.150
The others have already
advanced to the Tower.

02:47.940 --> 02:51.480
Talentless, a disgrace...

02:52.150 --> 02:54.650
I've been called like that
by my kin so many times.

02:55.920 --> 03:01.660
As proof, the illusion magic
is supposed to materialize illusions.

03:01.660 --> 03:04.290
Like what you saw during
the Grand Magic Festival.

03:04.870 --> 03:08.290
But my illusions have no physical form.

03:08.730 --> 03:13.090
You can't defeat enemies
with magic tricks.

03:13.840 --> 03:17.720
You're one of the top three in our year,
you do have skill.

03:17.720 --> 03:19.850
Didn't Lihanna tell you, did she?

03:19.850 --> 03:24.810
Those who are still in the Academy
right now are leftovers, the inferiors.

03:24.810 --> 03:26.350
Inferior?

03:26.820 --> 03:28.730
Being scouted at the Festival,

03:28.730 --> 03:32.110
or inventing new spells.

03:32.500 --> 03:38.470
A real talent finds a way to advance without
caring about the graduation process.

03:39.070 --> 03:43.870
For the past six years, all I've done is
watch the backs of such people.

03:45.080 --> 03:47.800
We're literally the leftovers.

03:48.370 --> 03:51.670
But you're skilled, too.
Everyone calls you Miss Perfect.

03:51.670 --> 03:54.050
That's just within the Academy.

03:55.390 --> 03:59.090
We're like big fish in a small pond.

03:59.760 --> 04:02.260
Above all, I was forced to see it.

04:02.850 --> 04:06.730
Seeing a girl my own age,
a first-year student just like me

04:06.730 --> 04:10.610
made it all the way to Magia Vander,
the true genius.

04:12.150 --> 04:13.980
Albis Vina.

04:13.980 --> 04:16.360
Elfaria Albis Serfort.

04:17.150 --> 04:22.160
I think I realized it deep down
from that moment.

04:22.160 --> 04:26.660
That "inferior" will never be
able to reach the true talent.

04:27.460 --> 04:34.630
The one who first made me taste the despair
of being "inferior" was my foster sister.

04:34.630 --> 04:36.050
Your foster sister?

04:36.050 --> 04:36.840
Yeah.

04:37.400 --> 04:41.330
The exalted Queen,
the pride of our kin.

04:42.050 --> 04:44.640
Does he mean Elleaf Canaan?

04:44.640 --> 04:46.680
Ellenor Ljos Alf.

04:47.130 --> 04:50.940
We grew up together,
and were very close.

04:51.730 --> 04:56.610
She was so small, so I thought
I needed to support her all the time.

05:17.510 --> 05:19.320
However...

05:19.920 --> 05:24.710
She turned out to be a high elf,
strong enough to create the Kingswood.

05:31.980 --> 05:37.940
After she became a Magia Vander,
I worked every day to chase her.

05:39.190 --> 05:42.490
But I'm still a flunkee as always.

05:42.490 --> 05:48.580
I'm an ugly elf who looks down on you
mages in an attempt to delude myself.

05:50.330 --> 05:53.500
I see. Now I get it.

05:53.500 --> 05:54.130
Huh?

05:54.130 --> 05:56.340
That's it!

05:56.340 --> 05:59.630
That explains why I've always been
feeling that we're similar.

06:00.880 --> 06:05.220
What are you talking about?
Stop trying to make me feel better!

06:05.220 --> 06:07.430
I'm no more than a dead weight.

06:07.430 --> 06:09.220
Just leave me here and keep going!

06:09.220 --> 06:11.430
I would never do that.

06:11.430 --> 06:12.890
I promise.

06:13.390 --> 06:15.020
It's okay, Wignall.

06:15.430 --> 06:17.150
You're an incredible elf.

06:17.940 --> 06:19.480
I know that well.

06:21.280 --> 06:24.910
Until you get back on your feet,
I'll protect you.

06:26.240 --> 06:30.410
I can tell that you all have an inferiority
complex towards the Tower.

06:30.910 --> 06:34.370
But I know a boy
who has always been working hard,

06:34.370 --> 06:37.000
even when people make fun of him
for being a no-talent.

06:38.380 --> 06:43.630
If he hears about this self-mocking,
he'll just laugh it off.

06:52.270 --> 06:54.640
NIGHTMARE EYE - 7 CREDITS
We've been running into

06:54.640 --> 06:55.900
GERGESA - 8 CREDITS
Five-Over Enemies all the time.

06:55.900 --> 06:57.150
GERGESA - 8 CREDITS
This floor is really on

06:57.150 --> 06:59.650
DEFORMIS SERPENT - 9 CREDITS
a completely different level.

07:01.860 --> 07:02.900
And yet...

07:03.790 --> 07:05.740
How is he able to take them
down that fast?

07:06.410 --> 07:08.910
Does he even realize how many
battles he fought by now?

07:21.570 --> 07:25.090
What's with this guy's stamina?

07:25.090 --> 07:26.840
Are you okay, Wignall?

07:33.140 --> 07:36.010
You've gotten all beaten up
because you keep protecting me.

07:37.350 --> 07:38.580
Why...

07:39.190 --> 07:42.020
Why don't you look down on me
like my kin does?

07:43.360 --> 07:48.490
Because I know that
you aren't a nasty elf.

07:53.830 --> 07:54.790
What's wrong?

07:56.660 --> 07:58.040
There's a strange sound.

08:03.630 --> 08:06.090
My Search isn't picking up anything.

08:06.470 --> 08:08.590
No, this is...

08:09.260 --> 08:11.660
The dungeon is making more monsters.

08:38.620 --> 08:41.250
It's burning...
Fire monsters?

08:41.250 --> 08:43.250
Those monsters are bad news!

08:47.800 --> 08:49.470
Torus Navalde!

08:56.440 --> 08:57.980
What are those monsters?

08:57.980 --> 09:03.150
Balkar, one of the Notorious Monsters,
is a unique species of this floor.

09:03.690 --> 09:05.320
They're worth 11 credits.

09:05.820 --> 09:08.570
Their body of flames are
immune to physical attacks.

09:08.570 --> 09:11.860
Moreover, they have
high magic resistance.

09:11.860 --> 09:14.740
That means they are natural enemies of mages

09:14.740 --> 09:17.290
BALKAR - 11 CREDITS
that are considered dangerous by the Tower.

09:17.290 --> 09:18.120
BALKAR - 11 CREDITS
Yeah.

09:18.120 --> 09:21.910
The only thing that works on them
is the Elven illusion magic.

09:23.080 --> 09:26.090
This is a dead end.
We have no choice but to fight.

09:26.090 --> 09:29.590
I can't beat those monsters alone.

09:30.380 --> 09:33.390
Wignall, I need your help.

09:39.100 --> 09:40.270
I can't!

09:40.270 --> 09:44.190
I told you, my illusion magic
is not perfect!

09:46.320 --> 09:48.030
I can't do it.

09:49.280 --> 09:52.070
Even if I try, I'll just...

09:52.860 --> 09:53.660
I'll just...

09:55.740 --> 09:57.160
...fail.

09:58.510 --> 09:59.910
It's okay to fail.

10:01.120 --> 10:03.580
It's okay to fail, Wignall.

10:03.580 --> 10:05.670
I mean, let's do it and fail!

10:06.420 --> 10:08.840
We're not geniuses.

10:08.840 --> 10:11.920
So we won't be able to move forward
if we don't fail.

10:12.380 --> 10:15.800
But if I fail, you'll...

10:15.800 --> 10:17.180
I won't die.

10:17.590 --> 10:21.310
Because our dreams are the same.

10:22.020 --> 10:24.850
Elfie's waiting for me in the Tower.

10:24.850 --> 10:27.960
I'm not going to die before that.

10:29.900 --> 10:33.450
That explains why I've always been
feeling that we're similar.

10:33.450 --> 10:35.320
It's okay, Wignall.

10:35.320 --> 10:37.530
You're an incredible elf.

10:37.530 --> 10:39.120
I know that well.

10:40.660 --> 10:45.990
We have the same dream,
but this difference...

11:00.140 --> 11:02.270
As he said,
sword attacks have no effect.

11:02.270 --> 11:04.390
I have to do it.

11:04.940 --> 11:06.020
Come on.

11:06.650 --> 11:10.400
Please work, please!

11:10.400 --> 11:12.150
Alluria!

11:19.160 --> 11:20.740
It didn't work.

11:21.740 --> 11:24.910
I knew it. My failure...

11:25.410 --> 11:27.250
...is going to kill him.

11:41.470 --> 11:42.850
Wignall!

11:42.850 --> 11:44.680
You can do it!
Don't give up!

11:45.230 --> 11:48.690
Your hard work up to this day has
definitely not been for nothing!

11:49.100 --> 11:50.690
I believe in you!

11:51.520 --> 11:53.030
He believes in me?

11:54.280 --> 11:58.700
He believes in me even though
my own kin doesn't?

11:58.700 --> 11:59.670
What are you doing?

11:59.670 --> 12:01.500
You're only going to keep
embarrassing us.

12:01.500 --> 12:02.700
Give it up, disgrace.

12:02.700 --> 12:03.930
Don't delude yourself.

12:04.700 --> 12:07.120
A stain of our people.

12:08.460 --> 12:14.340
Even if all of that is true,
I'm done being in fear of you all.

12:15.510 --> 12:19.390
I'm not going to betray his trust.

12:23.560 --> 12:27.730
I refuse to give up on you!

12:29.470 --> 12:31.480
Hear my call! Come forth!

12:31.480 --> 12:35.110
Grow, Alfs Ringhul!

12:47.540 --> 12:50.040
You did it, Wignall.

12:53.540 --> 12:55.300
Will Serfort.

12:55.750 --> 12:58.550
I would like to apologize
for my rudeness.

12:59.260 --> 13:02.300
You're a warrior worthy of respect.

13:06.970 --> 13:09.440
I wasn't going to say about it,

13:09.440 --> 13:10.740
but I'll say it.

13:12.230 --> 13:16.530
Me too.
I have always respected you.

13:43.800 --> 13:45.550
What are you doing?

13:45.550 --> 13:48.930
This is Rosty's magic item,
the Seekers Map.

13:48.930 --> 13:52.940
It would generate a map
using the user's blood.

13:55.060 --> 13:58.400
So you weren't just walking
around aimlessly.

13:58.400 --> 13:59.570
Yup.

13:59.990 --> 14:03.570
And Kiki remembers the smells of
Colette, Sion, and the others.

14:04.410 --> 14:06.330
As long as there was some scent left...

14:12.580 --> 14:15.460
I hope all of you are okay.

14:17.750 --> 14:19.880
Hey, do you have any water?

14:19.880 --> 14:23.260
Water is precious.
We can't just drink it carelessly.

14:23.260 --> 14:26.850
If you're that thirsty,
melt some of the ice you're so proud of.

14:26.850 --> 14:27.850
What?!

14:27.850 --> 14:29.350
As if I can afford to do that!

14:29.350 --> 14:31.480
We need to save our magic!

14:31.480 --> 14:33.480
We're already casting Search
every few mille!

14:33.480 --> 14:36.480
If you have the energy to yell,
how about preparing some water?!

14:36.480 --> 14:37.820
Don't mess with me!

14:37.820 --> 14:40.320
Not when all you can do is
create useless flames!

14:44.080 --> 14:45.700
Damn you, Sion.

14:45.700 --> 14:49.490
He's getting carried away now that
he's getting better at magic.

14:49.490 --> 14:52.250
We're already incompatible as it is.

14:52.790 --> 14:56.500
So it's not funny since we've both
been humiliated by that no-talent.

15:01.710 --> 15:02.550
Enemies are coming.

15:02.550 --> 15:05.050
Don't be ridiculous,
I used Search.

15:05.050 --> 15:07.180
We'd know if there were monsters.

15:07.180 --> 15:10.180
We just experienced this
on the 10th floor.

15:10.570 --> 15:12.810
Demons can escape Search detection.

15:21.190 --> 15:22.690
Evil Sentinels.

15:23.400 --> 15:25.320
I know we're in the Nightmare's Maw,

15:25.320 --> 15:27.990
but how can there be
so many Sentinels in one place?

15:27.990 --> 15:29.200
Is it a mass outbreak?

15:29.830 --> 15:33.700
Is it something to do with
that monster on the 10th floor?

15:34.200 --> 15:36.710
Hey, bring out your clones.

15:37.250 --> 15:40.710
They can still become our decoy
even if you can't control them.

15:40.710 --> 15:42.250
What are you saying?

15:42.250 --> 15:44.590
We've got no chance against
Sentinels that many.

15:44.590 --> 15:46.840
- We need to get out of here.
- Because of them,

15:47.280 --> 15:48.090
I was...

15:49.090 --> 15:53.350
...subjected to the greatest
humiliation of my life.

15:55.100 --> 15:57.370
I'm going to burn them all!

16:07.030 --> 16:10.320
Why are there Evil Sentinels here?

16:10.320 --> 16:11.490
Run for your lives!

16:19.630 --> 16:22.920
Tears of blood.
Blessed decapitation.

16:23.590 --> 16:25.880
Holy scythes of the cursed maiden.

16:28.380 --> 16:30.180
Zogglus Hilde.

16:35.600 --> 16:38.390
All students,
evacuate to the 6th floor immediately!

16:38.390 --> 16:41.900
The other Faculty and Guardians
will lead the way!

16:41.900 --> 16:43.400
Follow their instructions!

16:43.400 --> 16:44.710
Yes, Professor!

16:46.780 --> 16:47.900
Ed!

16:50.570 --> 16:53.200
Sky racing in the dungeon?

16:53.700 --> 16:56.200
No way.
That's just too amazing.

16:56.660 --> 16:58.660
Workner, any other students?

16:58.660 --> 17:00.170
Nearly all of them have evacuated.

17:00.170 --> 17:04.210
We're lucky that most of them haven't
made it past the 8th floor yet.

17:05.460 --> 17:07.590
Except for one party.

17:08.720 --> 17:10.800
Lihanna's party...

17:10.800 --> 17:12.470
According to prior reports,

17:12.470 --> 17:15.560
they should be making their way
to subjugate the floor keeper.

17:15.560 --> 17:17.390
The 10th floor is huge.

17:17.390 --> 17:21.310
We'll never find them
with so few masers.

17:21.310 --> 17:23.060
I know where they are.

17:23.480 --> 17:26.130
The familiar I gave to Will,
Kiki, is a Carbunkle.

17:26.130 --> 17:28.940
Kiki's crystal is linked to this orb.

17:29.510 --> 17:31.070
Will's party is...

17:31.640 --> 17:32.740
...on the 11th floor.

17:34.720 --> 17:35.660
Colette.

17:36.240 --> 17:37.830
Yeah, I'm coming.

17:44.210 --> 17:47.170
How long have we been here, Lihanna?

17:47.170 --> 17:51.130
From the time we fell to the 11th floor,
it's been 16 hours.

17:52.090 --> 17:54.720
We're running out of food and water.

17:54.720 --> 17:57.180
We've been resting whenever we can,

17:57.180 --> 18:00.600
but the monsters don't give us
much time for that.

18:00.600 --> 18:03.940
We've only made it this far
because of Lihanna.

18:04.600 --> 18:07.440
But still, she is already
reaching her limits.

18:07.440 --> 18:08.860
At this rate...

18:09.530 --> 18:11.360
I'm sorry, Colette.

18:13.450 --> 18:18.160
I put you all in danger
because I was too ambitious.

18:18.740 --> 18:20.830
This is all my fault.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.870
Don't say that!

18:21.870 --> 18:25.950
It's that monster's fault for suddenly
appearing on the 10th floor.

18:25.950 --> 18:28.550
Anyone can see that.

18:29.590 --> 18:32.130
Colette, but that...

18:32.130 --> 18:34.970
Besides, if you want to blame someone,

18:35.640 --> 18:40.020
it's my fault for selfishly tagging along
even though I wasn't invited.

18:43.230 --> 18:45.520
Thank you, Colette.

18:48.690 --> 18:49.820
We'll be okay.

18:50.700 --> 18:54.030
If it's Will, he will definitely
come to save us.

18:57.370 --> 19:01.450
Will, around that fork.
I detect mages there.

19:01.450 --> 19:02.370
Got it.

19:07.000 --> 19:08.290
Sion!

19:08.920 --> 19:10.550
There are traces everywhere.

19:11.050 --> 19:13.720
He defeated all these Sentinels
by himself?

19:16.800 --> 19:20.060
Not alone! I helped!

19:20.060 --> 19:21.560
Julius!

19:22.520 --> 19:25.310
Sure, his magic is tremendous.

19:25.310 --> 19:28.060
But look, how many clones
I had to sacrifice?

19:28.650 --> 19:32.030
How dare you treat Albis Vina's
secret art like that?!

19:33.020 --> 19:35.570
So you survived, Flunkee.

19:35.570 --> 19:36.360
Yeah.

19:36.360 --> 19:37.950
Good to see you're okay, too.

19:40.700 --> 19:42.950
The girls aren't with you?

19:42.950 --> 19:45.620
It's just the two of us here.

19:45.620 --> 19:47.460
I guess they're not with you, then.

19:47.460 --> 19:51.020
Oh no! That means the two of them
are still alone.

19:51.710 --> 19:54.630
Lihanna, Colette.

19:55.300 --> 19:57.180
Wait, Colette.

19:57.680 --> 19:59.970
Something feels off here.

20:01.600 --> 20:03.310
Professor Bruno?

20:14.940 --> 20:18.110
Good day to you, lovely ladies.

20:18.520 --> 20:21.370
Cut the talk, moron.

20:21.370 --> 20:24.910
You were supposed to take care of
things on the upper floors.

20:24.910 --> 20:28.620
How'd these brats get down here?

20:30.000 --> 20:33.130
Looks like the Duke wasn't
able to finish them off.

20:33.130 --> 20:36.630
Maybe it destroyed the floor
and they fell here.

20:36.630 --> 20:39.010
Don't act like it's someone
else's problem.

20:39.010 --> 20:43.310
Thanks to your games,
our cover has been completely blown.

20:43.310 --> 20:45.640
Don't be angry, Marze.

20:46.220 --> 20:48.390
What? Those heads...

20:48.390 --> 20:51.900
Did you kill the professors?

20:51.900 --> 20:54.900
Who are you people?

21:10.170 --> 21:12.430
We're just bad guys.

21:13.570 --> 21:16.130
We want to destroy the fake sky.

21:16.800 --> 21:19.550
Fake sky? Could it be...

21:19.550 --> 21:21.300
The Great Barrier of the Magia Vanders?

21:21.300 --> 21:22.640
Wait, hold on.

21:22.640 --> 21:26.120
According to the Lore, the Calamity
will begin when the Barrier falls.

21:26.930 --> 21:29.020
Well, since you're here...

21:29.020 --> 21:32.730
Mind if I take your heads?

21:36.150 --> 21:36.820
Bye-bye.

21:48.330 --> 21:50.460
Sorry, we're late.

21:51.370 --> 21:52.620
Will!

21:53.460 --> 21:56.710
And everyone else, too.
How did you find us?

21:56.710 --> 21:59.710
Thanks to Kiki and your ore trail.

21:59.710 --> 22:02.720
We found a trail of stones on the ground.

22:02.720 --> 22:05.720
We followed it and it led us here.

22:05.720 --> 22:08.970
Rather than that,
who are those guys?

22:10.180 --> 22:12.230
He has no head.

22:13.980 --> 22:16.980
Look at all these cute heads.

22:21.360 --> 22:23.110
While I hold them off, all of you—

22:23.110 --> 22:23.860
Bang!

22:35.210 --> 22:37.710
You are all good.

22:38.250 --> 22:40.210
I'm getting chills.

22:40.210 --> 22:44.970
I'd love to add your heads
to my collection.

22:44.970 --> 22:46.640
Time's up.

22:46.640 --> 22:49.470
Troublesome bunch is heading this way.

22:49.470 --> 22:52.480
We're going to go retrieve that thing.

22:52.480 --> 22:54.890
What a shame.

22:54.890 --> 22:58.110
In that case, kill them all...

22:58.610 --> 22:59.650
Duke.

23:05.240 --> 23:08.240
A gate? That's the Mage Queen's
teleportation secret art.

23:08.240 --> 23:10.330
Don't tell me, that's...

23:10.330 --> 23:11.750
You must be kidding.

23:12.160 --> 23:15.750
The monster that appeared
on the 10th floor.

23:22.960 --> 23:25.260
A monster worth 270 credits.

23:25.800 --> 23:27.840
Evil Grand Duke.

23:36.640 --> 23:41.150
Next up, Episode 11 of
Wistoria: Wand and Sword,

23:41.150 --> 23:43.230
"The True Name of Cowardice."
